        "root_concepts": "[family, demographic]",
        "section": "sociology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Family and Demographic Change",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SECOND DEMOGRAPHIC TRANSITION (SDT) — late 20th century–present:\n  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  Non-marriage, cohabitation (not leading to marriage)\n  Delayed first marriage + delayed childbearing\n  Fertility below replacement (TFR < 2.1) — \"lowest low\" fertility in S. Europe/Japan\n  Rise of voluntary childlessness + lone parenthood\n  LGBTQ+ family formation"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FAMILY-DEMOGRAPHIC-CHANGE.md#006",
      "path": [
        "06-FAMILY-DEMOGRAPHIC-CHANGE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
