        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Family and Demographic Change",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CAUSE (SDT — Van de Kaa / Lesthaeghe):\n    Not poverty: happens in wealthy postindustrial societies\n    → Value shift: self-actualization, autonomy, gender egalitarianism\n    → Contraceptive revolution (1960s pill): decouples sex from reproduction\n    → Women's labor force participation → opportunity cost of motherhood rises\n    → \"Individualization thesis\": intimate life becomes a reflexive project"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FAMILY-DEMOGRAPHIC-CHANGE.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-FAMILY-DEMOGRAPHIC-CHANGE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
